{
  "page": 74,
  "title": "Caravan — Page 74",
  "act": "Act Two",
  "source": "existing rendered rehearsal audio; bulk-indexed from accepted manifests; needs final display-copy QA before export",
  "status": "provisional-existing-render",
  "lines": [
    {
      "n": 1,
      "sourceEntry": 1182,
      "speaker": "MONICA",
      "kind": "spoken",
      "text": "That’s not the bed dear. She’s not used to alcohol, poor thing.",
      "src": "audio/pages/74/lines/001_monica_c7f2350b1a8_norm.mp3",
      "duration": 3.344,
      "speed": null,
      "voiceName": "Charlotte - Warm & Conversational"
    },
    {
      "n": 2,
      "sourceEntry": 1183,
      "speaker": "RODNEY",
      "kind": "spoken",
      "text": "Gwendolyn doesn’t drink!",
      "src": "audio/pages/74/lines/002_rodney_7db7f12facf_norm.mp3",
      "duration": 1.3,
      "speed": null,
      "voiceName": "Ty Frost private clone"
    },
    {
      "n": 3,
      "sourceEntry": 1184,
      "speaker": "GWENDOLYN",
      "kind": "spoken",
      "text": "She does now! Whee!",
      "src": "audio/pages/74/lines/003_gwendolyn_b762e23ab28_norm.mp3",
      "duration": 1.579,
      "speed": null,
      "voiceName": "Lily - Velvety Actress"
    },
    {
      "n": 4,
      "sourceEntry": 1185,
      "speaker": "PENNY",
      "kind": "spoken",
      "text": "I thought you were taking a shower?",
      "src": "audio/pages/74/lines/004_penny_5432f26d1b9_norm.mp3",
      "duration": 1.765,
      "speed": null,
      "voiceName": "KYLIE - AUSTRALIAN FEMALE FRIENDLY WARM"
    },
    {
      "n": 5,
      "sourceEntry": 1186,
      "speaker": "MONICA",
      "kind": "spoken",
      "text": "We drove to the pub instead and consumed a whole bottle of brandy. Lovely!",
      "src": "audio/pages/74/lines/005_monica_813f7677653_norm.mp3",
      "duration": 4.18,
      "speed": null,
      "voiceName": "Charlotte - Warm & Conversational"
    },
    {
      "n": 6,
      "sourceEntry": 1187,
      "speaker": "GWENDOLYN",
      "kind": "spoken",
      "text": "Lovely!",
      "src": "audio/pages/74/lines/006_gwendolyn_388dcbdd9d1_norm.mp3",
      "duration": 0.789,
      "speed": null,
      "voiceName": "Lily - Velvety Actress"
    },
    {
      "n": 7,
      "sourceEntry": 1187,
      "speaker": "DIRECTOR",
      "kind": "inline_stage_direction",
      "text": "She collapses on the lower bunk, bumping her head as she does so.",
      "src": "audio/pages/74/lines/007_director_7287720a126_norm.mp3",
      "duration": 2.427,
      "speed": "1.5x",
      "voiceName": "Ockle Jane - Dry Wit"
    },
    {
      "n": 8,
      "sourceEntry": 1187,
      "speaker": "GWENDOLYN",
      "kind": "spoken",
      "text": "Oh, head. Hurtie, hurtie. Keeps hurtie.",
      "src": "audio/pages/74/lines/008_gwendolyn_f488aa274d0_norm.mp3",
      "duration": 2.276,
      "speed": null,
      "voiceName": "Lily - Velvety Actress"
    },
    {
      "n": 9,
      "sourceEntry": 1188,
      "speaker": "MONICA",
      "kind": "spoken",
      "text": "For some reason she keeps regressing to childhood.",
      "src": "audio/pages/74/lines/009_monica_68b595a49eb_norm.mp3",
      "duration": 2.554,
      "speed": null,
      "voiceName": "Charlotte - Warm & Conversational"
    },
    {
      "n": 10,
      "sourceEntry": 1189,
      "speaker": "GWENDOLYN",
      "kind": "spoken",
      "text": "Sleep. Sleep. I sleep now.",
      "src": "audio/pages/74/lines/010_gwendolyn_79337d02553_norm.mp3",
      "duration": 2.043,
      "speed": null,
      "voiceName": "Lily - Velvety Actress"
    },
    {
      "n": 11,
      "sourceEntry": 1190,
      "speaker": "MONICA",
      "kind": "spoken",
      "text": "That’s it dear. You sleep it off. I think I’ll have another drink.",
      "src": "audio/pages/74/lines/011_monica_c9c877ab501_norm.mp3",
      "duration": 3.39,
      "speed": null,
      "voiceName": "Charlotte - Warm & Conversational"
    },
    {
      "n": 12,
      "sourceEntry": 1190,
      "speaker": "DIRECTOR",
      "kind": "inline_stage_direction",
      "text": "She heads for the fridge, stops and takes in RODNEY and PENNY",
      "src": "audio/pages/74/lines/012_director_acb6ada691e_norm.mp3",
      "duration": 2.289,
      "speed": "1.5x",
      "voiceName": "Ockle Jane - Dry Wit"
    },
    {
      "n": 13,
      "sourceEntry": 1190,
      "speaker": "MONICA",
      "kind": "spoken",
      "text": "Well! I know we’re having a week of niceness but this is ridiculous!",
      "src": "audio/pages/74/lines/013_monica_adb467f5119_norm.mp3",
      "duration": 3.715,
      "speed": null,
      "voiceName": "Charlotte - Warm & Conversational"
    },
    {
      "n": 14,
      "sourceEntry": 1191,
      "speaker": "RODNEY",
      "kind": "spoken",
      "text": "Monica, it’s not what you think!",
      "src": "audio/pages/74/lines/014_rodney_0ccc49bed83_norm.mp3",
      "duration": 1.533,
      "speed": null,
      "voiceName": "Ty Frost private clone"
    },
    {
      "n": 15,
      "sourceEntry": 1192,
      "speaker": "MONICA",
      "kind": "spoken",
      "text": "You don’t know what I’m thinking. I don’t mind. Feel free.",
      "src": "audio/pages/74/lines/015_monica_e02dc78215b_norm.mp3",
      "duration": 2.415,
      "speed": null,
      "voiceName": "Charlotte - Warm & Conversational"
    },
    {
      "n": 16,
      "sourceEntry": 1192,
      "speaker": "DIRECTOR",
      "kind": "inline_stage_direction",
      "text": "Pause",
      "src": "audio/pages/74/lines/016_director_360f0c227d7_norm.mp3",
      "duration": 0.59,
      "speed": "1.5x",
      "voiceName": "Ockle Jane - Dry Wit"
    },
    {
      "n": 17,
      "sourceEntry": 1192,
      "speaker": "MONICA",
      "kind": "spoken",
      "text": "I am surprised you’re both finally being so open about it.",
      "src": "audio/pages/74/lines/017_monica_ef5ee44f2c5_norm.mp3",
      "duration": 2.879,
      "speed": null,
      "voiceName": "Charlotte - Warm & Conversational"
    },
    {
      "n": 18,
      "sourceEntry": 1193,
      "speaker": "RODNEY",
      "kind": "spoken",
      "text": "The annexe is flooded.",
      "src": "audio/pages/74/lines/018_rodney_bca3c990d0f_norm.mp3",
      "duration": 1.254,
      "speed": null,
      "voiceName": "Ty Frost private clone"
    },
    {
      "n": 19,
      "sourceEntry": 1194,
      "speaker": "PENNY",
      "kind": "spoken",
      "text": "I’m sleeping with you and Rodney. We tossed for it.",
      "src": "audio/pages/74/lines/019_penny_d2cc117315c_norm.mp3",
      "duration": 3.344,
      "speed": null,
      "voiceName": "KYLIE - AUSTRALIAN FEMALE FRIENDLY WARM"
    },
    {
      "n": 20,
      "sourceEntry": 1195,
      "speaker": "MONICA",
      "kind": "spoken",
      "text": "And you lost.",
      "src": "audio/pages/74/lines/020_monica_f0e530d4a4b_norm.mp3",
      "duration": 1.161,
      "speed": null,
      "voiceName": "Charlotte - Warm & Conversational"
    },
    {
      "n": 21,
      "sourceEntry": 1195,
      "speaker": "DIRECTOR",
      "kind": "inline_stage_direction",
      "text": "Takes the wine cask and pours a drink.",
      "src": "audio/pages/74/lines/021_director_243e50c6ba2_norm.mp3",
      "duration": 1.301,
      "speed": "1.5x",
      "voiceName": "Ockle Jane - Dry Wit"
    },
    {
      "n": 22,
      "sourceEntry": 1195,
      "speaker": "MONICA",
      "kind": "spoken",
      "text": "I’ll sleep on the floor. It’s easier to swim for safety when the caravan goes down.",
      "src": "audio/pages/74/lines/022_monica_1d15fed4959_norm.mp3",
      "duration": 4.087,
      "speed": null,
      "voiceName": "Charlotte - Warm & Conversational"
    },
    {
      "n": 23,
      "sourceEntry": 1196,
      "speaker": "DIRECTOR",
      "kind": "stage_direction_before",
      "text": "SHE sinks to the floor, cuddling the wine cask.",
      "src": "audio/pages/74/lines/023_director_137622cd782_norm.mp3",
      "duration": 1.884,
      "speed": "1.5x",
      "voiceName": "Ockle Jane - Dry Wit"
    },
    {
      "n": 24,
      "sourceEntry": 1196,
      "speaker": "PENNY",
      "kind": "spoken_source_typo_fix",
      "text": "We’re only in bed together….I mean sharing a bed. I don’t know what you’re carrying on about. Really.",
      "src": "audio/pages/74/lines/024_penny_8a4f09a893a_norm.mp3",
      "duration": 8.591,
      "speed": null,
      "voiceName": "KYLIE - AUSTRALIAN FEMALE FRIENDLY WARM"
    },
    {
      "n": 25,
      "sourceEntry": 1197,
      "speaker": "MONICA",
      "kind": "spoken",
      "text": "Penny! Isn’t it enough I have to be nice on this dreadful holiday, do I have to pretend to be stupid as well? I know. I know about you and Rodney. And I don’t mind. See how nice I can be when I put my mind to it?",
      "src": "audio/pages/74/lines/025_monica_a8760e65a59_norm.mp3",
      "duration": 16.533,
      "speed": null,
      "voiceName": "Charlotte - Warm & Conversational"
    },
    {
      "n": 26,
      "sourceEntry": 1198,
      "speaker": "RODNEY",
      "kind": "spoken",
      "text": "You’ve had too much to drink.",
      "src": "audio/pages/74/lines/026_rodney_4dc600aa95f_norm.mp3",
      "duration": 1.347,
      "speed": null,
      "voiceName": "Ty Frost private clone"
    },
    {
      "n": 27,
      "sourceEntry": 1199,
      "speaker": "DIRECTOR",
      "kind": "inline_stage_direction",
      "text": "gleefully",
      "src": "audio/pages/74/lines/027_director_5e0003c6b7a_norm.mp3",
      "duration": 0.491,
      "speed": "1.5x",
      "voiceName": "Ockle Jane - Dry Wit"
    },
    {
      "n": 28,
      "sourceEntry": 1199,
      "speaker": "MONICA",
      "kind": "spoken",
      "text": "Yes, and I get terribly truthful.",
      "src": "audio/pages/74/lines/028_monica_87aafe4fbf4_norm.mp3",
      "duration": 2.043,
      "speed": null,
      "voiceName": "Charlotte - Warm & Conversational"
    }
  ]
}